      "source": "本机 Codex ~/.codex/skills/verify-shadowhook",
      "content": "---\nname: verify-shadowhook\ndescription: Guide for installing and integrating ShadowHook into Verify Xposed or Inject cloud-code modules. Use when Codex should call install_shadowhook, package ShadowHook resource zips, load native libraries through host or module ClassLoaders, diagnose init errors or namespace failures, or install native hooks against host libraries.\n---\n\n# Verify ShadowHook\n\n## Overview\n\nUse this skill for ShadowHook-specific Verify work. Use `verify-framework` alongside it for general cloud-code publishing, resources, tokens, and device diagnostics.\n\n## Reference Routing\n\n- Architecture, MCP installer, and generated artifacts: `references/shadowhook-install.md`\n- Resource layout, Java loader, resource readiness, and host bridge Dex: `references/shadowhook-java-runtime.md`\n- Native handle reuse, hook installation, publish, and validation: `references/shadowhook-native.md`\n- Init errors, namespace failures, pending hooks, exits, and tombstones: `references/shadowhook-troubleshooting.md`\n\n`references/shadowhook-verify-guide.md` remains a compact compatibility index.\n\n## Core Rules\n\n- Treat Verify cloud code as already executing inside the host process.\n- Load ShadowHook once through its official Java loader.\n- Keep `libshadowhook_nothing.so` available in the bound native directory, but do not preload it before `ShadowHook.init()`.\n- From native code, reuse the loaded handle with `RTLD_NOLOAD`.\n- Keep every selected ABI complete for ShadowHook and custom hook libraries.\n- Wait for the Verify resource callback before consuming zip artifacts.\n- Bind the shared private native directory when the cloud DexClassLoader is created, append the bridge Jar to that loader, and verify both classes have identical defining loaders.\n- Preserve existing cloud source and resource entries during automated installation.\n- Start with exact signatures and a narrow hook surface; retain and call original functions correctly.\n\n## Preferred Workflow\n\n1. Inspect config, runtime type, target ABIs, current source, and resource zip.\n2. Use `mcp__verify.install_shadowhook` with `dryRun=true` for preparation when available.\n3. Review generated bridge, wrapper entry, merged zip, Hashes, and ABI coverage.\n4. Run the complete installer or publish resources before the compiled Dex.\n5. Restart the host and inspect Java, Verify, and native logs.\n6. Confirm ShadowHook init result, native handle reuse, hook registration, and host stability.\n\n## Required Runtime Pattern\n\n```text\nVerify resource zip ready\n  -> copy bridge and ABI-matched SO files to host-private storage\n  -> cloud DexClassLoader starts with that native directory in its search path\n  -> append bridge Jar to the cloud entry DexClassLoader\n  -> verify bridge.getClassLoader() == cloud entry.getClassLoader()\n  -> official ShadowHook Java init\n  -> System.load(custom hook SO)\n  -> native RTLD_NOLOAD reuse\n  -> install exact-symbol hooks\n```\n\nUse `SHADOWHOOK_ERRNO_PENDING` as a valid registration state when the target library or symbol loads later. Correlate pending/installed status with target library load timing before changing the hook.\n\n## Verification Baseline\n\nConfirm the relevant evidence:\n\n- resource zip Hash and Dex Hash match the applied config\n- all selected ABIs contain every logical library\n- logs show official Java initialization result\n- logs show reuse of the loaded ShadowHook handle\n- hooks report installed or expected pending state\n- host process remains alive, or crash/tombstone evidence identifies the failing layer\n\nRead only the routed reference needed for the current stage.\n",
      "enabled": true,
      "built_in": true,
      "category": "逆向分析",
      "sort_order": 71,
      "description": "Guide for installing and integrating ShadowHook into Verify Xposed or Inject cloud-code modules. Use when Codex should call install_shadowhook, package ShadowHook resource zips, load native libraries through host or module ClassLoaders, diagnose init errors or namespace failures, or install native hooks against host libraries.",
      "package_files": [
        {
          "path": "agents/openai.yaml",
          "content": "interface:\n  display_name: \"Verify ShadowHook\"\n  short_description: \"Verify 框架内加载 ShadowHook 指南\"\n  default_prompt: \"Use $verify-shadowhook to install ShadowHook with Verify MCP and validate the host runtime integration.\"\n"
        },
        {
          "path": "references/shadowhook-install.md",
          "content": "# Verify ShadowHook Installation\n\n## 成功架构\n\nVerify/Xposed 模块注入宿主后，云代码 dex 在宿主进程内执行。ShadowHook 失败时优先检查 ClassLoader/native namespace，而不是假设“不在同一进程”。\n\n稳定方案：\n\n```text\nVerify resource zip\n  -> HookHelper.getUnzipDir()\n  -> copy SO files to the fixed verify_cloud_native directory\n  -> cloud DexClassLoader is created with that directory in nativeLibrarySearchPath\n  -> CloudDexClassLoaderBridge appends the host bridge jar to the cloud entry DexClassLoader\n  -> verify bridge and cloud entry have the same defining ClassLoader\n  -> ShadowHostBridge imports com.bytedance.shadowhook.ShadowHook\n  -> ShadowHook.init(ConfigBuilder...)\n  -> System.load(libzmxy_native.so)\n  -> native dlopen(libshadowhook.so, RTLD_NOLOAD)\n  -> dlsym ShadowHook APIs\n  -> shadowhook_hook_sym_name_2(...)\n```\n\n关键点：\n\n- ShadowHook 由官方 Java loader 加载和初始化。\n- `libshadowhook_nothing.so` 只复制到预绑定 native 目录，不在 `ShadowHook.init()` 前加载。\n- native hook 库只复用已加载的 `libshadowhook.so`。\n- native 侧不要再 `dlopen(path)` 加载第二份 ShadowHook。\n- Bridge Jar 必须追加到云端入口自身的 `DexClassLoader`，不能再创建独立 child loader。\n- `verify_cloud_native` 必须在云 `DexClassLoader` 构造时进入 `nativeLibrarySearchPath`；构造后只改 `DexPathList` 不会回写已创建的 linker namespace。\n- `System.load()` 必须由该 loader 定义的 Bridge 类调用，ShadowHook 和自定义 Hook SO 才具有一致的 native library ownership。\n\n## MCP 一键完整安装\n\n当前 Verify MCP 提供 `install_shadowhook`。它会安装官方 ShadowHook `2.0.1`、host bridge、\n可选 Hook SO、资源包和云代码包装入口，并保留配置已有 ZIP 与业务源码。\n\n最小调用：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"configId\": 44,\n  \"runtime\": \"xposed\"\n}\n```\n\n带自定义 Hook SO：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"configId\": 44,\n  \"runtime\": \"inject\",\n  \"abis\": [\"arm64-v8a\", \"armeabi-v7a\"],\n  \"hookLibraries\": [\n    {\"abi\": \"arm64-v8a\", \"path\": \"/absolute/arm64-v8a/libdemo_hook.so\"},\n    {\"abi\": \"armeabi-v7a\", \"path\": \"/absolute/armeabi-v7a/libdemo_hook.so\"}\n  ],\n  \"recordable\": true,\n  \"debuggable\": false\n}\n```\n\n执行阶段：\n\n1. 读取配置、resource zip、编译设置和云代码源码快照。\n2. 校验固定 AAR/bridge SHA-256，并检查 Hook SO 的 ELF 文件头和 ABI 覆盖。\n3. 安全解包并合并旧 ZIP；旧业务资源保留，历史 installer-owned 文件先清理再写入。\n4. 生成 `ShadowHookBootstrap` 和 `ShadowHookEntry`，包装入口调用原业务入口。\n5. 先编译生成代码；编译成功后上传 ZIP，再应用 Dex。\n6. 复核最终 `zipHash`，返回 `installed=true`、`stage=complete`、`dexHash`、`zipHash`。\n\n重要参数：\n\n- `workspacePath`：配置已有 Dex 但服务端没有源码快照时，传原云代码源码目录。\n- `dryRun=true`：只生成合并 ZIP、回滚 ZIP 和完整源码目录。\n- `outputDir`：指定本地产物目录。\n- `aarPath`：使用本地官方 AAR，仍按内置 digest 校验。\n- `replaceExistingDex=true`：显式选择用 loader-only Dex 替换没有源码的已有 Dex。\n\n`hookLibraries` 由云端 ClassLoader 中的 host bridge 按逻辑库顺序执行 `System.load()`。自定义 SO应在\n`JNI_OnLoad` 中安装 Hook，或由项目代码继续调用它自己的 Java/native 入口；native 侧使用\n`dlopen(\"libshadowhook.so\", RTLD_NOW | RTLD_NOLOAD)` 复用已经初始化的 handle。\n\n重复安装会读取生成入口中的 delegate 元数据，不会让 `ShadowHookEntry` 调用自身。相同 ZIP 输入、\nABI 和 Hook SO 会生成相同 ZIP 字节与 Hash。\n"
        },
        {
          "path": "references/shadowhook-java-runtime.md",
          "content": "# Verify ShadowHook Java Runtime\n\n## 资源包结构\n\n推荐把文件放进 Verify resource zip：\n\n```text\npayload/lib/arm64-v8a/libshadowhook.so\npayload/lib/arm64-v8a/libshadowhook_nothing.so\npayload/lib/arm64-v8a/libzmxy_native.so\npayload/lib/arm64-v8a/shadowhook-host-2.0.1-dex.jar\npayload/lib/armeabi-v7a/libshadowhook.so\npayload/lib/armeabi-v7a/libshadowhook_nothing.so\npayload/lib/armeabi-v7a/libzmxy_native.so\npayload/lib/armeabi-v7a/shadowhook-host-2.0.1-dex.jar\n```\n\n也可使用 `lib/<abi>/...`，但加载器要同时兼容：\n\n```java\nFile candidate = new File(unzipDir, \"lib/\" + abi + \"/\" + name);\nFile candidate2 = new File(unzipDir, \"payload/lib/\" + abi + \"/\" + name);\n```\n\n## Java 云代码加载器\n\n云代码侧负责：\n\n1. 等待 resource zip 写入完成。\n2. 从 `HookHelper.getUnzipDir()` 找 ABI 文件。\n3. 把 SO 复制到 Runtime 在云 loader 创建前绑定的 `verify_cloud_native` 目录。\n4. 清理 Verify zip cache。\n5. 将只读 host bridge Jar 追加到云端入口的 `DexClassLoader`。\n6. 使用同一个 loader 加载并调用 `ShadowHostBridge.init(...)`。\n\n核心代码形态：\n\n```java\nprivate static void initHostLoader(Context context, File hostJar) throws Exception {\n    File optDir = new File(context.getCodeCacheDir(), \"shadowhook_host_opt\");\n    if (!optDir.exists()) optDir.mkdirs();\n    File nativeDir = CloudDexClassLoaderBridge.getCloudNativeLibraryDirectory(\n            context.getCodeCacheDir());\n\n    hostBridgeClass = CloudDexClassLoaderBridge.loadCompanionClass(\n            ShadowHookBootstrap.class,\n            hostJar,\n            optDir,\n            nativeDir,\n            \"com.xy.zmxy.host.ShadowHostBridge\");\n    if (hostBridgeClass.getClassLoader() != ShadowHookBootstrap.class.getClassLoader()) {\n        throw new IllegalStateException(\"ShadowHook bridge ClassLoader mismatch\");\n    }\n}\n```\n\n资源准备完成后调用：\n\n```java\nHookHelper.clearZipCache();\n```\n\n这样可以避免旧版 resource zip 干扰。\n\n### 等待 resource zip\n\n资源 zip 写入与云代码入口执行是异步链路；`main()` 已执行不代表 `HookHelper.getUnzipDir()` 一定可用。native 加载不要只依赖启动瞬间的一次尝试，也不要用旧 cache 目录 fallback 到历史 so/jar。\n\n如果 Verify 提供资源写入回调，注册一次回调并在回调里重试加载：\n\n```java\nResourceTaskManager.submitTask(new ResourceTaskCallback() {\n    @Override\n    public void onResourceWritten(ResourceTaskManager.ResourceTask task) {\n        scheduleTryLoad(context, \"resource-ready\", 0L);\n    }\n}, false);\n```\n\n推荐策略：\n\n- 启动时可以做一次低成本 `scheduleTryLoad(context, \"start\", 0L)`。\n- 同时提交 `ResourceTaskManager.submitTask(callback, false)`，让资源就绪后触发最终加载。\n- 加载源以当前 `HookHelper.getUnzipDir()` 为准，复制到宿主私有目录时覆盖写入。\n- 不做未校验版本戳的历史 cache fallback，避免新 dex 加载旧版 `libshadowhook.so`、hook so 或 bridge jar。\n- UI 可以先显示；hook 功能执行时再检查 native bridge 是否 loaded。\n\n## Host Bridge dex\n\nHost Bridge 是一个很小的 jar/dex，唯一职责是让 ShadowHook 官方 Java loader 在正确的 ClassLoader/native namespace 下运行。\n\n```java\npackage com.xy.zmxy.host;\n\nimport com.bytedance.shadowhook.ShadowHook;\n\npublic final class ShadowHostBridge {\n    private static boolean nativeLoaded;\n    private static int shadowHookInitResult = -3000;\n\n    private ShadowHostBridge() {}\n\n    public static synchronized int init(Class<?> logBridgeClass,\n                                        String shadowPath,\n                                        String nativePath,\n                                        String traceDir,\n                                        String buildLabel) {\n        if (shadowHookInitResult == -3000) {\n            ShadowHook.Config config = new ShadowHook.ConfigBuilder()\n                    .setMode(ShadowHook.Mode.SHARED)\n                    .setRecordable(true)\n                    .setLibLoader(new ShadowHook.ILibLoader() {\n                        @Override\n                        public void loadLibrary(String libName) {\n                            System.load(shadowPath);\n                        }\n                    })\n                    .build();\n            shadowHookInitResult = ShadowHook.init(config);\n        }\n\n        if (!nativeLoaded) {\n            System.load(nativePath);\n            nativeLoaded = true;\n        }\n\n        return nativeInit(logBridgeClass, traceDir, buildLabel, shadowPath, shadowHookInitResult);\n    }\n\n    public static int getShadowHookInitResult() {\n        return shadowHookInitResult;\n    }\n\n    private static native int nativeInit(Class<?> logBridgeClass,\n                                         String traceDir,\n                                         String buildLabel,\n                                         String shadowHookPath,\n                                         int shadowHookInitResult);\n}\n```\n\n说明：\n\n- Bridge 与云端入口由同一个 `DexClassLoader` 定义。\n- 云 `DexClassLoader` 构造时必须已经包含 `verify_cloud_native`，让 ShadowHook 内部对 nothing SO 的 basename `dlopen` 进入正确 namespace。\n- `System.load(nativePath)` 由 Bridge 类发起，使 ShadowHook 与 hook 库进入云端 Dex 的相同加载上下文。\n- `libshadowhook_nothing.so` 必须存在，但 Bridge 不得预加载；ShadowHook 依赖它的首次构造回调完成 `soinfo` 扫描。\n"
        },
        {
          "path": "references/shadowhook-native.md",
          "content": "# Verify ShadowHook Native Integration\n\n## Native 侧复用 ShadowHook\n\nnative 初始化时接收 Java loader 的 `shadowHookInitResult` 和 `shadowHookPath`。\n\n```cpp\n#ifndef RTLD_NOLOAD\n#define RTLD_NOLOAD 4\n#endif\n\nstatic void* g_shadowhook_handle = nullptr;\nstatic std::string g_shadowhook_path;\n\nstatic bool resolve_shadowhook() {\n    if (!g_shadowhook_handle) {\n        if (!g_shadowhook_path.empty()) {\n            g_shadowhook_handle = dlopen(g_shadowhook_path.c_str(), RTLD_NOW | RTLD_NOLOAD);\n        }\n        if (!g_shadowhook_handle) {\n            g_shadowhook_handle = dlopen(\"libshadowhook.so\", RTLD_NOW | RTLD_NOLOAD);\n        }\n        if (!g_shadowhook_handle) {\n            log(\"reuse loaded shadowhook handle failed\");\n            return false;\n        }\n    }\n\n    p_shadowhook_init = (ShadowhookInitFn)dlsym(g_shadowhook_handle, \"shadowhook_init\");\n    p_shadowhook_hook_sym_name_2 =\n            (ShadowhookHookSymName2Fn)dlsym(g_shadowhook_handle, \"shadowhook_hook_sym_name_2\");\n    p_shadowhook_get_errno =\n            (ShadowhookGetErrnoFn)dlsym(g_shadowhook_handle, \"shadowhook_get_errno\");\n    p_shadowhook_to_errmsg =\n            (ShadowhookToErrmsgFn)dlsym(g_shadowhook_handle, \"shadowhook_to_errmsg\");\n\n    return p_shadowhook_init && p_shadowhook_hook_sym_name_2\n           && p_shadowhook_get_errno && p_shadowhook_to_errmsg;\n}\n```\n\n初始化逻辑：\n\n```cpp\nif (!resolve_shadowhook()) {\n    return -1000;\n}\n\nif (shadowhook_java_init_result == SHADOWHOOK_ERRNO_OK && g_shadowhook_handle_reused) {\n    log(\"shadowhook initialized by Java loader\");\n} else {\n    if (shadowhook_java_init_result != SHADOWHOOK_ERRNO_OK) {\n        return -shadowhook_java_init_result;\n    }\n    int rc = p_shadowhook_init(SHADOWHOOK_MODE_SHARED, false);\n    if (rc != SHADOWHOOK_ERRNO_OK) {\n        return -rc;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n原则：\n\n- `-1000` 表示 native 侧没拿到已加载的 ShadowHook handle。\n- 成功路径应该看到 `reuse loaded libshadowhook by path`。\n- 不要在 `resolve_shadowhook()` 失败后执行普通 `dlopen(shadowHookPath, RTLD_NOW)`，否则可能加载第二份 ShadowHook。\n\n## 安装 hook\n\n推荐封装：\n\n```cpp\nstatic bool install_one(const char* symbol, void* replacement, void** original, const char* label) {\n    void* stub = p_shadowhook_hook_sym_name_2(\n            \"libcocos2djs.so\",\n            symbol,\n            replacement,\n            original,\n            SHADOWHOOK_HOOK_WITH_UNIQUE_MODE);\n\n    int err = p_shadowhook_get_errno();\n    log(\"ShadowHook %s stub=%p orig=%p errno=%d %s\",\n        label, stub, original ? *original : nullptr, err, shadowhook_errmsg(err));\n\n    return stub != nullptr\n           && (err == SHADOWHOOK_ERRNO_OK || err == SHADOWHOOK_ERRNO_PENDING);\n}\n```\n\n`SHADOWHOOK_ERRNO_PENDING` 可视为安装有效：目标 so 或符号尚未加载时，ShadowHook 会 pending 注册。\n\n对 cocos2d-js，建议从低干扰 hook 开始：\n\n```cpp\nJava_org_cocos2dx_lib_Cocos2dxJavascriptJavaBridge_evalString\n_ZN13ScriptingCore13compileScriptEPKcP8JSObjectP9JSContext\n_ZN13ScriptingCore9runScriptEPKc\n_Z15JS_DecodeScriptP9JSContextPKvjP12JSPrincipals\n```\n\n风险较高的 hook：\n\n- `ScriptingCore::evalString`，容易影响游戏自退/脚本执行流程。\n- 任何签名不确定的 SpiderMonkey API。\n- 在 hook 内递归调用 JS 引擎、JNI 或高频日志。\n\n## 推送和验证\n\n使用当前 MCP 时优先调用 `install_shadowhook`。手工发布或旧版 MCP 的常见顺序：\n\n1. 构建 native hook so 和 host bridge jar。\n2. 打包 `resHook.zip`。\n3. 用 Verify 更新配置资源 zip。\n4. 用 Verify 发布云代码 dex。\n5. 重启或触发宿主 app。\n6. 检查 app 私有目录 trace log。\n\n泛化命令：\n\n```bash\nadb shell pidof <host.package>\nadb shell su -c 'tail -200 /data/data/<host.package>/files/<trace-dir>/native-YYYYMMDD.log' | tr -d '\\r'\nadb shell su -c 'grep -R \"ShadowHook\\\\|native hook\" /data/data/<host.package>/files/<trace-dir>' | tr -d '\\r'\n```\n\n期望日志：\n\n```text\nShadowHook host init result=0\nreuse loaded libshadowhook by path\nshadowhook initialized by Java loader\nnative hook install attempt=1 build=... shadowhook=2.0.1 trace=...\nShadowHook <label> stub=0x... orig=0x... errno=0\nnative hook install result installed=<n>\n```\n\n\n"
        },
        {
          "path": "references/shadowhook-troubleshooting.md",
          "content": "# Verify ShadowHook Troubleshooting\n\n## 故障定位\n\n### native init 返回 -1000\n\n含义：native 层 `RTLD_NOLOAD` 没有复用到已加载的 `libshadowhook.so`。\n\n检查：\n\n- `ShadowHook.init(config)` 是否已执行且返回 0。\n- bridge jar 是否追加到了云端入口的 `DexClassLoader`。\n- bridge 与 `ShadowHookBootstrap` 的 `getClassLoader()` 是否严格相等。\n- `libshadowhook.so` 是否复制到了正确 ABI 目录。\n- native 是否错误地先于 Java loader 执行。\n- 是否误用了自定义 loader 或普通 `dlopen(path)` 导致第二份库。\n\n### Java init 非 0\n\n检查：\n\n- ShadowHook 版本和 Java API 是否匹配。\n- `libshadowhook.so` / Java dex 是否来自同一版本。\n- Android ABI 是否匹配。\n- 是否缺少 `libshadowhook_nothing.so`。\n\n错误码 12 要结合 `shadowhook_tag` 日志细分：\n\n- `linker: dlopen nothing.so FAILED`：云 loader 创建时没有把 `verify_cloud_native` 放进 `nativeLibrarySearchPath`，或 nothing SO 未复制到该目录。\n- `memory_scan_pre, check offsets FAILED`：先检查 Bridge 是否在 `ShadowHook.init()` 前执行过 `System.loadLibrary(\"shadowhook_nothing\")`。nothing SO 是一次性构造探针，提前加载会让 ShadowHook 初始化时的第二次 `dlopen` 不再触发构造回调。移除预加载并重启进程后仍复现，再检查设备 linker `soinfo` 布局差异。\n\n### `UnsatisfiedLinkError`\n\n检查：\n\n- ShadowHook 与自定义 Hook SO 使用 Bridge 发起的绝对路径 `System.load()`；nothing SO 只复制到预绑定目录，由 ShadowHook 初始化内部首次 `dlopen`。\n- 目标文件有读取/执行权限。\n- ABI 路径与设备 ABI 一致。\n- hook so 依赖是否都可解析。\n\n### hook pending 或 installed=0\n\n`PENDING` 可以接受；`installed=0` 要检查：\n\n- 目标库名是否正确，例如 `libcocos2djs.so`。\n- 符号是否存在：`nm -D` / `readelf -Ws`。\n- C++ mangled name 是否匹配宿主版本。\n- hook 安装是否发生得太早，且未允许 pending。\n\n### 应用退出但没有 tombstone\n\n优先认为是 Java/game 逻辑主动退出，而不是 native 崩溃。检查：\n\n- `Activity.finish*`\n- `moveTaskToBack`\n- `Process.killProcess`\n- `System.exit`\n- `Runtime.exit`\n- 游戏脚本里的检测/自退逻辑\n\n### SIGSEGV / tombstone\n\n优先检查：\n\n- hook 函数签名是否完全匹配。\n- 是否在 hook 内释放了仍被原函数使用的指针。\n- 是否在 hook 内重入 ShadowHook/JS 引擎。\n- 是否调用了 ABI 不明确的 JS API。\n- 是否把 `JS::Handle<T>` 当普通裸指针传错。\n\n## Android 15 / namespace 注意点\n\nAndroid 15 下更容易暴露 namespace 和 linker 行为问题。稳定方式仍然是：\n\n- 官方 Java loader 负责加载 ShadowHook。\n- bridge dex 追加到云端入口的 ClassLoader，不创建第二个 `DexClassLoader`。\n- `verify_cloud_native` 在云 loader 构造时进入 `nativeLibrarySearchPath`，而不是构造后才追加。\n- hook so 从同一 bridge 里 `System.load()`。\n- native 只 `RTLD_NOLOAD` 复用。\n\n不要把 ShadowHook 作为“外部进程服务”加载；hook 目标必须在同一进程地址空间内。Verify 注入后执行外部 dex 仍在宿主进程内，重点是保证同一 ClassLoader/native namespace。\n"
        },
        {
          "path": "references/shadowhook-verify-guide.md",
          "content": "# Verify ShadowHook Reference Index\n\nThe original combined guide is split into focused references:\n\n- Installation and architecture: `shadowhook-install.md`\n- Java loading and host bridge: `shadowhook-java-runtime.md`\n- Native integration and hook installation: `shadowhook-native.md`\n- Troubleshooting and Android namespace behavior: `shadowhook-troubleshooting.md`\n\nStart from `../SKILL.md` and load the narrowest matching reference.\n"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "version": 4,
